BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//FinanceRateCalc//US mortgage rule expiry calendar//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
METHOD:PUBLISH
X-WR-CALNAME:US mortgage rule expiries (FinanceRateCalc)
X-WR-CALDESC:When FHA and conforming loan limits\, MIP and HOEPA/QM thresholds stop being valid\, and when replacements are expected.
REFRESH-INTERVAL;VALUE=DURATION:P1W
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:498ca8579b879736@financeratecalc.com
DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261124
SUMMARY:Expected: FHFA announces 2027 conforming loan limits
DESCRIPTION:FHFA announced the 2026 values on 2025-11-25 and the 2025 values on 2024-11-26\; the last Tuesday of November is the pattern\, not a commitment. When the release appears\, the 2027 rule file is drafted the same day and published after a human check. Certainty: expected (pattern of recent years). Rule file: https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fhfa-conforming-loan-limits-2026.json
URL:https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fhfa-conforming-loan-limits-2026.json
CATEGORIES:announcement
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7e54d2e20d05b318@financeratecalc.com
DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261210
SUMMARY:Expected: HUD Mortgagee Letter with 2027 FHA forward loan limits
DESCRIPTION:HUD published ML 2025-23 (the 2026 limits) on 2025-12-11\, about two weeks after FHFA. Expected\, not promised. Certainty: expected (pattern of recent years). Rule file: https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fha-forward-loan-limits-2026.json
URL:https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fha-forward-loan-limits-2026.json
CATEGORIES:announcement
END:VEVENT
