DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
SUMMARY:Expected: CFPB publishes 2027 HOEPA and QM thresholds
DESCRIPTION:The 2026 thresholds were published 2025-12-15 (90 FR). Expected\, not promised. Certainty: expected (pattern of recent years). Rule file: https://financeratecalc.com/rules/cfpb-hoepa-qm-thresholds-2026.json
URL:https://financeratecalc.com/rules/cfpb-hoepa-qm-thresholds-2026.json
CATEGORIES:announcement
END:VEVENT
