BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:b6dce67701fe9543@financeratecalc.com
DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
SUMMARY:2027 values take effect: FHA limits\, conforming limits\, HOEPA/QM thresholds
DESCRIPTION:Every 2026 limit becomes a historical value. Anything that says 'the 2027 limit is $832\,750' is wrong from this day. The public re-scan of stale constants runs on 2027-01-02 and is published as eval/stale-constants-scan-2027-01-02.json. Certainty: fixed by the rule. Rule file: https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fhfa-conforming-loan-limits-2026.json
URL:https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fhfa-conforming-loan-limits-2026.json
CATEGORIES:effective
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bc235b7701b4b37a@financeratecalc.com
DTSTAMP:20261018T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Pre-registered re-scan: how much public code still carries 2026 limits
DESCRIPTION:Pre-registered 2026-10-18. The same stale-constant scan that found 29 repositories with 2025 values in October 2026 runs on this date against the 2026 values\, and its result is published unedited. Prediction: at least 20 public repositories will carry a 2026 limit as current on 2027-01-02. Certainty: pre-registered. Rule file: https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fhfa-conforming-loan-limits-2026.json
URL:https://financeratecalc.com/rules/fhfa-conforming-loan-limits-2026.json
CATEGORIES:measurement
